---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Online Hex Board Game (hexboardgame.com)"
  description="Privacy policy and Google AdSense third-party cookie disclosure for Online Hex Board Game (hexboardgame.com)."
>
  <Header />

  <main class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-16 text-slate-300">
    <div class="nes-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-cyan-400/30 flex flex-col gap-6">
      
      <div class="border-b border-cyan-500/20 pb-4">
        <span class="text-[9px] font-['Press_Start_2P'] text-cyan-300">LEGAL & COMPLIANCE</span>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white font-['Outfit'] mt-1">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono mt-1">
          Last Updated: August 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 font-sans">
        <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">1. Overview</h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to <strong>hexboardgame.com</strong> ("Online Hex Board Game"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we handle data and adhere to standard Google AdSense and global privacy compliance standards (GDPR, CCPA).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            We do not require account registration, usernames, or passwords to play. Gameplay telemetry, high scores, and sound preferences are stored locally on your device via standard browser <code>localStorage</code> and are never transmitted to our servers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">3. Google AdSense & Third-Party Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            We use Google AdSense to serve advertisements when you visit our website. Google and its advertising partners use cookies (including the DoubleClick DART cookie) to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other websites on the internet.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-1 text-slate-400">
            <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to your website or other websites.</li>
            <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to your sites and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
            <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline hover:text-cyan-300">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline hover:text-cyan-300">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">4. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)</h2>
          <p>
            Under the CCPA, California consumers have the right to request disclosure of personal data collected, request deletion of collected data, and opt out of the sale of personal information. As we do not sell personal data, your gameplay experience remains confidential.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white font-['Outfit']">5. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to get in touch, please contact us at: <span class="font-mono text-cyan-300">support@hexboardgame.com</span>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-cyan-500/20">
        <a href="/" class="nes-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono font-bold">
          ← Return to Game
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
